1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,572
You don't need a time machine to look into the past.

2
00:00:02,702 --> 00:00:06,107
Step outside tonight and look up… you're already doing it.

3
00:00:06,237 --> 00:00:10,539
Light has a speed limit: about 300,000 km a second.

4
00:00:10,669 --> 00:00:13,624
So the Moon you see is 1.3 seconds old.

5
00:00:13,754 --> 00:00:15,908
The Sun? 8 minutes.

6
00:00:16,038 --> 00:00:20,662
That star? Its light left hundreds, even thousands, of years ago.

7
00:00:20,792 --> 00:00:22,876
You're seeing every era at once.

8
00:00:23,006 --> 00:00:24,916
The night sky isn't a photograph.

9
00:00:25,154 --> 00:00:26,507
It's a museum.
